      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Driscoll%2C_North_Dakota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A four‑room consolidated school once perched on a hill midway between the town’s cemeteries, serving generations of students.",
